[00:01.08]This is normal
[00:02.75]Life is nominal… right?
[00:04.55]This is just
[00:07.08]…I’m not working as designed
[00:12.53]NOT WORKING AS DESIGNED
[00:14.60]DESIGNED
[00:18.98]WORKING AS DESIGNED
[00:27.14]I wake up tired
[00:28.37]want back to sleep
[00:30.30]dreams feel safer
[00:31.85]than anything
[00:34.04]keep it quiet
[00:34.90]keep it clean
[00:35.65]hide the noise
[00:36.22]behind the screen
[00:37.21]good kids don’t—
[00:37.81]talk back
[00:38.68]good kids just—
[00:39.49]relapse
[00:40.33]good kids smile
[00:41.11]good kids stay
[00:41.86]good kids try—
[00:42.67]again again again
[00:43.96]again again again
[00:47.32]I feel it coming in waves again
[00:49.45]like something I forgot to name
[00:53.53]I play it off, I laugh it out
[00:56.05]but it leaks out anyway
[00:58.63]not now — not now — not now
[01:01.21]something’s slipping
[01:02.20]I don’t know what
[01:03.81]TOMORROW — tomorrow
[01:05.25]tomorrow — again
[01:07.04]RESTART — restart
[01:08.04]start it — stop it
[01:09.26]not now — not now
[01:10.40]not now — again
[01:13.03]same — same — same
[01:14.29]same — same — same
[01:15.46]again
[01:17.45]same — same — same
[01:18.56]again
[01:19.68]RESET
[01:21.12]Side effects may vary
[01:23.43]mine just stayed
[01:24.98]got a brain that loops
[01:26.64]every mistake
[01:28.26]loud at night
[01:29.09]hurt all day
[01:29.96]make it funny
[01:30.87]so it stays
[01:31.46]“you’re so strong”
[01:32.15]“you survived”
[01:32.81]cool—
[01:33.68]but I never made it out alive
[01:35.04]PLEASE CONTINUE
[01:36.56]PROGRESS EXPECTED
[01:38.21]heartbeat out of sync again
[01:39.62]every gaze feels like a test
[01:41.40]every sound a loaded gun
[01:43.07]every thought stuck in my brain
[01:44.93]not now — not now — shut down
[01:47.48]something’s wrong with timing
[01:49.07]I can’t stop it now
[01:51.03]RESTART
[01:52.07]RETRY
[01:52.73]TOMORROW — tomorrow
[01:53.70]tomorrow — again
[01:54.81]RESTART — restart
[01:56.06]start it — stop it
[01:57.32]not now — not now
[01:58.56]not now
[02:00.20]again
[02:01.40]safe, I’m safe, I’m safe
[02:03.23]I’m never safe
[02:04.50]calm calm calm
[02:05.57]fake
[02:06.39]I’m okay
[02:07.31]I’m okay
[02:09.03]…just don’t look at me like that
[02:10.94]PROCESS FAILED
[02:13.43]It’s not a memory
[02:15.30]it’s a reflex
[02:16.86]It’s not the past
[02:18.24]it’s next
